# ── HTTP Security Headers — Expérience Esthétique J.F.W ──────────────────
# Applied to every page by Netlify at the server level.
# Meta-tag CSP cannot set frame-ancestors or X-Frame-Options — only headers can.
# Headers: clickjacking block, MIME sniff prevention, referrer policy,
#          feature policy lock-down, and HSTS.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
